WEBVTT

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.832
They're so still.

00:00:21.709 --> 00:00:25.546
They're trees.
What'd you expect?

00:00:26.714 --> 00:00:28.382
They used to dance.

00:00:30.718 --> 00:00:34.805
Wasn't long after you left
that the Telmarines invaded.

00:00:34.889 --> 00:00:39.977
Those who survived retreated
to the woods. And the trees,

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:44.690
they retreated so deep into themselves
that they haven't been heard from since.

00:00:44.774 --> 00:00:48.819
I don't understand. How could
Aslan have let this happen?

00:00:48.903 --> 00:00:53.574
Aslan? Thought he abandoned
us when you lot did.

00:00:58.579 --> 00:01:00.664
We didn't mean to leave, you know.

00:01:02.041 --> 00:01:04.376
Makes no difference now, does it?

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:09.006
Get us to the Narnians... and it will.

00:01:46.627 --> 00:01:47.878
Hello, there.

00:01:49.797 --> 00:01:52.842
(grunting)

00:01:52.925 --> 00:01:56.428
It's all right. We're friends.

00:01:57.304 --> 00:01:59.640
(grunts)

00:02:02.309 --> 00:02:07.523
- Don't move, Your Majesty.
- (growling)

00:02:11.318 --> 00:02:12.778
Stay away from her!

00:02:17.157 --> 00:02:20.744
- Shoot, Susan! Shoot!
- (Lucy screaming)

00:02:32.214 --> 00:02:36.343
- Why wouldn't he stop?
- I suspect he was hungry.

00:02:51.191 --> 00:02:52.359
Thanks.

00:02:55.696 --> 00:02:57.072
He was wild.

00:02:58.741 --> 00:03:00.492
I don't think he could talk at all.

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:04.788
Get treated like
a dumb animal long enough,

00:03:04.872 --> 00:03:07.374
that's what you become.

00:03:08.959 --> 00:03:13.797
You may find Narnia
a more savage place than you remember.

00:03:13.881 --> 00:03:15.883
- (blade cuts)
- (sobbing)

00:03:29.438 --> 00:03:32.524
- (rustling)
- I can hear you.

00:03:35.319 --> 00:03:38.489
I just think we should wait
for the kings and queens.

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:43.535
Fine! Go then! See if the others
will be as understanding!

00:03:43.619 --> 00:03:47.748
Or maybe I'll come with you. I want to
see you explain things to the minotaurs.

00:03:49.458 --> 00:03:50.584
Minotaurs?

00:03:52.086 --> 00:03:53.128
They're real?

00:03:53.212 --> 00:03:54.672
And very bad-tempered.

00:03:54.755 --> 00:03:58.092
- Yeah, not to mention big.
- Huge.

00:03:59.426 --> 00:04:02.346
What about centaurs?
Do they still exist?

00:04:02.429 --> 00:04:05.349
Well, the centaurs will
probably fight on your side.

00:04:05.432 --> 00:04:08.519
But there's no telling
what the others will do.

00:04:10.437 --> 00:04:11.981
What about Aslan?

00:04:17.486 --> 00:04:19.989
How do you know
so much about us?

00:04:20.531 --> 00:04:22.741
- Stories.
- Wait a minute.

00:04:22.825 --> 00:04:25.494
Your father told you
stories about Narnia?

00:04:26.328 --> 00:04:27.997
No, my professor, he...

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:33.419
Listen, I'm sorry.
These are not the kind of questions

00:04:33.502 --> 00:04:35.629
you should be asking.

00:04:37.798 --> 00:04:40.009
- What is it?
- Human.

00:04:40.092 --> 00:04:42.678
- Him?
- No. Them.

00:04:42.761 --> 00:04:46.223
(men shouting)

00:04:46.306 --> 00:04:48.475
- There they are!
- Run!

00:04:50.853 --> 00:04:53.313
(shouting)

00:05:00.988 --> 00:05:02.406
Now!

00:05:08.495 --> 00:05:10.456
Oh! Ah!

00:05:11.957 --> 00:05:14.084
- Oh, no.
- Wait. I'll go.

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:22.634
Take it. Go! It's more
important than I am.

00:05:27.347 --> 00:05:29.016
(grunts)

00:05:31.685 --> 00:05:33.020
Whoa! Uh!

00:05:40.986 --> 00:05:42.571
Oh!

00:05:47.701 --> 00:05:50.621
- (panting)
- (squeaking)

00:05:56.251 --> 00:05:57.836
Get him out of here.

00:06:02.257 --> 00:06:03.342
Ah!

00:06:08.388 --> 00:06:09.598
Where are you?

00:06:12.059 --> 00:06:13.519
Ah!

